  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Natural Resources for Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall program development objective (PDO) of the program is to support the Government of Indonesia in addressing the governance challenges and maximizing the opportunities of its natural resource sectors (oil and gas, minerals and coal) to contribute to broad-based and sustainable development.</narrative>
